<body>
  <div class="container">
    <div class="content">
      <h1>Create your indicators and Expert Advisors</h1>
      <div class="text">
        <p>With the trading platform, you gain access to a whole ecosystem for algorithmic traders. If you can't find the desired solution among <a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/market?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">existing applications</a>, you can create your own trading strategies and indicators. The ecosystem provides advanced tools and services for developers of any level. The extensive knowledge base and powerful development tools offer a swift learning curve for beginners and assist professionals in reaching qualitatively new levels.</p>
        <h2>The ecosystem offers:</h2>
        <ul>
          <li><a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/docs?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">MetaQuotes Language 5</a> for developing technical indicators, trading robots, and utilities. This is an advanced, high-level language, closely resembling C++ in syntax, allowing you to write programs using object-oriented programming.</li>
          <li>Professional editing tool <a href="https://www.metatrader5.com/en/automated-trading/metaeditor?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">MetaEditor</a> offering intelligent code handling, debugging, and profiling options. The editor facilitates the development of trading applications of any complexity level. <br></li>
          <li><a href="https://www.metatrader5.com/en/automated-trading/strategy-tester?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">Strategy Tester</a> with support for visual testing, optimization, genetic algorithms, and a distributed testing agent network, among other features. Simulate Expert Advisor operation on any price history segment and analyze comprehensive reports.<br></li>
          <li>Subversion-based <a href="https://www.metatrader5.com/en/metaeditor/help/mql5storage/mql5storage_working?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">MQL5 Storage</a> with a version control. Safely store your files, access them from anywhere in the world, and collaborate on large projects whenever necessary.<br></li>
          <li>The largest free <a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/code?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">Code Base</a> featuring source codes of applications for the trading platform. Explore ready-made examples of Expert Advisors, technical indicators, scripts and libraries and use them as a base to create your own applications.<br></li>
          <li>Unique knowledge base – thousands of pages featuring detailed <a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/docs?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">documentation</a> and <a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/articles?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">expert articles</a> covering various aspects of programming.<br></li>
        </ul>
        <p>For professional developers, we offer a specialized site where you can offer your products and expertise to millions of users. <a href="https://www.mql5.com/?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">MQL5.community</a>, the largest community of algorithmic traders, will open up even more new opportunities for you. Discuss your ideas in the <a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/forum?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">Forum</a>, sell your programs on the <a
            href="https://www.mql5.com/en/market?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers"
            target="_blank">Market</a>, or take on <a href="https://www.mql5.com/en/job?utm_source=mt5terminal&utm_medium=special&utm_campaign=en.mail.developers" target="_blank">Freelance</a> projects – earn recognition and income from your programming skills with MQL5.community.</p>
      </div>
